<item><title><![CDATA[Round-ish Is Good Enough]]></title><description><![CDATA[This guest post is for you if you've ever wondered how planetary orbits were worked out.]]></description><link>https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-kepler-and-elliptical</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-kepler-and-elliptical</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Becario]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 05:44:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!l9pP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><em>This post is written in Spanish on purpose. You don&#8217;t need to understand every word; just keep reading.</em></p><p>En el cap&#237;tulo de hoy de comprensi&#243;n lectora seguiremos hablando de grandes figuras de la ciencia. <em>Sorry, my science geek nature has been flaring lately. You&#8217;re welcome!</em></p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!l9pP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!l9pP!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!l9pP!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!l9pP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!l9pP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!l9pP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg" width="1200" height="1600" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1600,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1511959,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Statue of Kepler &amp; Brahe&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/i/215083841?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="Statue of Kepler &amp; Brahe" title="Statue of Kepler &amp; Brahe" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!l9pP!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!l9pP!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!l9pP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!l9pP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20a6f890-d496-430c-8a36-797420061c05_1200x1600.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">Photo by Andrzej Otr&#281;bski, CC BY-SA 4.0, Wikimedia</figcaption></figure></div><p></p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class="callout-block" data-callout="true"><p>Johannes Kepler quer&#237;a descubrir las reglas matem&#225;ticas del universo, pero para lograrlo necesitaba algo que &#233;l no ten&#237;a: datos muy precisos sobre las estrellas. Estas mediciones pertenec&#237;an a Tycho Brahe, un astr&#243;nomo que pas&#243; a&#241;os anotando la posici&#243;n exacta de los planetas. En esa &#233;poca todav&#237;a no exist&#237;a el telescopio, pero el trabajo de Brahe era incre&#237;blemente exacto. Kepler logr&#243; trabajar con &#233;l y, tras la muerte de Brahe, hered&#243; todos sus cuadernos de notas para continuar con la investigaci&#243;n.</p><p></p><p>El gran objetivo de Kepler era demostrar que los planetas se mov&#237;an en c&#237;rculos perfectos. Esta idea no era nueva: los antiguos griegos ya ten&#237;an una fuerte preferencia por el c&#237;rculo porque lo consideraban la forma geom&#233;trica m&#225;s bella y pura. Incluso Nicol&#225;s Cop&#233;rnico, cuando revolucion&#243; la astronom&#237;a un siglo antes al proponer que la Tierra giraba alrededor del Sol, sigui&#243; asumiendo que las &#243;rbitas ten&#237;an que ser circulares. Kepler compart&#237;a este mismo pensamiento est&#233;tico.</p><p></p><p>Sin embargo, al intentar aplicar la teor&#237;a del c&#237;rculo al planeta Marte, los datos de Brahe no encajaban por una diferencia muy peque&#241;a. Cualquier otra persona habr&#237;a ignorado un error tan m&#237;nimo, pero Kepler quer&#237;a la perfecci&#243;n. Tras varios a&#241;os de c&#225;lculos dif&#237;ciles, acept&#243; que los c&#237;rculos no funcionaban y descubri&#243; que los planetas se mueven en forma de <strong>elipse</strong>, que es como un c&#237;rculo alargado u &#243;valo.</p><p></p><p>Esta historia nos ense&#241;a c&#243;mo funciona la ciencia de verdad. La belleza de las teor&#237;as cient&#237;ficas no son algo que le preocupen a la Madre Naturaleza. Kepler tuvo la honestidad de abandonar una idea milenaria para aceptar lo que la realidad le demostraba, y gracias a eso cambi&#243; la astronom&#237;a para siempre.</p></div><h2>Cuestionario de autoevaluaci&#243;n</h2><p>Veamos qu&#233; tal se te ha dado. No pasa nada si no has entendido todo a la primera. Intenta contestar todas las preguntas, y vuelve a repasar el texto si te falta alguna respuesta. &#161;Mucho &#225;nimo!</p><p>Suscr&#237;bete gratuitamente para ver el cuestionario. Y si te parece que el contenido lo vale, merece la pena, y te lo puedes permitir, tambi&#233;n puedes convertirte en suscriptor de pago para ayudar a que sigamos creando m&#225;s contenido como este.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>El cuestionario contiene preguntas de tipo test para evaluar tu comprensi&#243;n lectora.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-kepler-and-elliptical?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary button-wrapper" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-kepler-and-elliptical?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share"><span>Share</span></a></p><p>Si te ha parecido interesante suscr&#237;bete, comparte, deja tus comentarios, o dale a &#8220;Like &#10084;&#65039;&#8221;. Eso nos ayuda a crecer y a seguir motivados, y te lo agradeceremos de coraz&#243;n.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-kepler-and-elliptical/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-kepler-and-elliptical/comments"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p><p><strong>&#191;Y t&#250;? &#191;Conoc&#237;as la historia de Johannes Kepler y Tycho Brahe?</strong></p>]]></content:encoded></item>